    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-01T00:41:52Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Bumblebees can learn to open flowers by watching another bee, then remember the technique—useful evidence that some insects pick up skills socially.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#53d65f0be9d243489c32f4d3b9b5ac0bcf21e35aa6ee013a65906e2bc643d7e7</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-01T00:41:52Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In South Korea, restaurants and households separate food scraps for composting and animal feed; turning leftovers into useful resources is an established part of waste reduction.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#f85c8768432e81250adc07820461dfd8726b7c64955baf83e54b75ac88e32e7e</id>
    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-01T00:41:52Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Send a neighbour a quick message asking what local bird they’ve spotted lately, then share your own sighting; it’s an easy way to start a friendly exchange.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
